    "questionText": "Как сканировать Docker образы на уязвимости?",
    "shortAnswer": "Trivy/Grype/Docker Scout в CI: `trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --exit-code 1`. Три момента: build-time gate, admission, continuous re-scan. OS CVE — bump base; app CVE — update deps.",
    "idealAnswer": "Scanner match installed packages vs NVD/GitHub Advisories. Tools: Trivy (trivy image --exit-code 1), Grype, Docker Scout (recommendations). CI: trivy-action, never || true. Multi-stage scan in Dockerfile. Admission: Kyverno, Cosign attestation. Continuous: nightly re-scan — new CVE vs old bytes. OS CVE: alpine bump; app CVE: package.json update. .trivyignore с rationale. SBOM buildx --sbom=true. Ошибки: scan без gate; build-time only; один scanner; ignore SBOM.",
